# This file is OPTIONAL.
#
# In the default layout — the repo sitting inside the legacy tree as NAVX/navx/ —
# the legacy root is auto-detected as the parent directory and you need no .env
# at all. Copy this file only if the legacy tree lives somewhere else.
#
# A path that is not a legacy tree is ignored with a warning rather than failing
# the run, so a stale .env copied between machines cannot break the build.

# Absolute path to the legacy NAVX tree (the folder containing Catalogue/, Files/, Examples/).
# Read only — never copied into the repo.
# NAVX_LEGACY_ROOT=/absolute/path/to/NAVX

# Port for the static harness server Playwright starts.
# NAVX_HARNESS_PORT=4317
